 "html": "<img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/news/6a3c8f8696770.png\">\n<p>2026年度 院生組職棋甄選-第一日，於7/1(三)在海峰棋院舉行，當日上午進行報到抽籤後，隨即進行第一輪賽事，</p>\n<p>第一日由王亮勛、姬孝天、吳少珷，取得二連勝暫時領先。</p>\n<p>詳細對戰成績如下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/2026%E5%B9%B4%20%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8%20%E8%B3%BD%E7%A8%8B%E8%A1%A8_page-0001%20%281%29.jpg\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Xhz_vCrPZabRw6aZyicbITl6UgoLrhDx2WhOhiRfikk/edit?usp=sharing\">2026 院生組 職棋甄選 - 成績表 (更新中)</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_1.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_21.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_16.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_18.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_20.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.haifong.org/upload/ckfinder/images/LINE_ALBUM_2026%E9%99%A2%E7%94%9F%E7%B5%84%E8%81%B7%E6%A3%8B%E7%94%84%E9%81%B8_260701_22.jpg\"></p>"
